        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "cleansing-the-gate-of-elidinis:147bl9b",
          "html": "Enter <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/The_Gate_of_Elidinis_(scenery)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Gate of Elidinis stream</a>.",
          "text": "Enter The Gate of Elidinis stream.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "cleansing-the-gate-of-elidinis:1xtiho2",
          "html": "Cleanse <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/The_Gate_of_Elidinis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Gate of Elidinis</a>.",
          "text": "Cleanse The Gate of Elidinis.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "cleansing-the-gate-of-elidinis:1xtiho2:9zdb9h",
              "html": "Begin the encounter. Staying south of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Moonstone_conduit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">moonstone conduits</a> will make learning The Gate of Elidinis encounter easier.",
              "text": "Begin the encounter. Staying south of the moonstone conduits will make learning The Gate of Elidinis encounter easier.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "cleansing-the-gate-of-elidinis:1xtiho2:s7ud8z",
              "html": "Gather 25-40 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Moonstone_fragments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">moonstone fragments</a> from nearby <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Moonstone_(The_Gate_of_Elidinis)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">moonstone</a> outcrops. Moonstone fragments provide 10% barrier strength per repair action on any of the moonstone conduits. Moonstone fragments also deal 7,500 damage per throw to summoned <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Feline_akh_(Ode_of_the_Devourer)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">feline akhs</a> by clicking on the feline akhs.",
              "text": "Gather 25-40 moonstone fragments from nearby moonstone outcrops. Moonstone fragments provide 10% barrier strength per repair action on any of the moonstone conduits. Moonstone fragments also deal 7,500 damage per throw to summoned feline akhs by clicking on the feline akhs.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "cleansing-the-gate-of-elidinis:1xtiho2:1cw2drp",
              "html": "Repair any of the moonstone conduits located in the middle of the encounter with moonstone fragments until the barrier&#39;s strength reaches at least 30%. Staying south of the moonstone conduits will use their barrier strength to reduce the damage taken from each &quot;Begone!&quot; mechanic proportional to the barrier&#39;s strength. This mechanic also depletes up to 30% of the barriers strength.",
              "text": "Repair any of the moonstone conduits located in the middle of the encounter with moonstone fragments until the barrier's strength reaches at least 30%. Staying south of the moonstone conduits will use their barrier strength to reduce the damage taken from each \"Begone!\" mechanic proportional to the barrier's strength. This mechanic also depletes up to 30% of the barriers strength.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "cleansing-the-gate-of-elidinis:1xtiho2:1n5b1o6",
              "html": "Transmute any <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Corrupt_shard_of_Elidinis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">corrupt shard of Elidinis</a> until it becomes a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cleansed_shard_of_Elidinis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">cleansed shard of Elidinis</a>. Transmuting adds corruption stacks which increases the damage the player takes over time in the encounter.",
              "text": "Transmute any corrupt shard of Elidinis until it becomes a cleansed shard of Elidinis. Transmuting adds corruption stacks which increases the damage the player takes over time in the encounter.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "cleansing-the-gate-of-elidinis:1xtiho2:110eksi",
              "html": "Mine the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cleansed_shard_of_Elidinis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">cleansed shard of Elidinis</a> to obtain <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cleansed_statue_shard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">cleansed statue shards</a>.",
              "text": "Mine the cleansed shard of Elidinis to obtain cleansed statue shards.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "cleansing-the-gate-of-elidinis:1xtiho2:1s6sbgj",
              "html": "Activate the action button once 10+ cleansed statue shards have been collected to ask <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Icthlarin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Icthlarin</a> for aid. This will spawn pillars to help the player jump up to The Gate of Elidinis, consuming all the cleansed statue shards on them and applying a damage bonus depending on how quick the player performed all the jumps. Corruption stacks decrease by the amount of cleansed statue shards consumed with the jump.",
              "text": "Activate the action button once 10+ cleansed statue shards have been collected to ask Icthlarin for aid. This will spawn pillars to help the player jump up to The Gate of Elidinis, consuming all the cleansed statue shards on them and applying a damage bonus depending on how quick the player performed all the jumps. Corruption stacks decrease by the amount of cleansed statue shards consumed with the jump.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "cleansing-the-gate-of-elidinis:1xtiho2:1w73g4y",
              "html": "Stand within Icthlarin&#39;s protective shield after performing all the jumps. Icthlarin&#39;s shield will mitigate the incoming attack. The attack also depletes all the barrier strength from the moonstone conduits.",
              "text": "Stand within Icthlarin's protective shield after performing all the jumps. Icthlarin's shield will mitigate the incoming attack. The attack also depletes all the barrier strength from the moonstone conduits.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "cleansing-the-gate-of-elidinis:1xtiho2:wht8ql",
              "html": "Keep collecting cleansed statue shards by transmuting corrupt shards of Elidinis and mining cleansed shards of Elidinis, using the action button as needed, repairing the moonstone conduits as needed, and clicking on summoned feline akhs to throw moonstone fragments at them.",
              "text": "Keep collecting cleansed statue shards by transmuting corrupt shards of Elidinis and mining cleansed shards of Elidinis, using the action button as needed, repairing the moonstone conduits as needed, and clicking on summoned feline akhs to throw moonstone fragments at them.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
